 "segments": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "s": 0.35,
   "e": 6.587,
   "text": "Recognizing these fundamental barriers explains why frontier industrial research laboratories",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.237,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "s": 6.971,
   "e": 11.361,
   "text": "have converged on a brilliant architectural synthesis.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.39,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "s": 12.709,
   "e": 17.251,
   "text": "Consider the breakthrough architecture of DeepSeek-V3, released in late 2024.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.542,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "s": 17.951,
   "e": 23.804,
   "text": "The DeepSeek team did not abandon the Transformer in pursuit of unstructured biological plasticity.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.853,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "s": 24.787,
   "e": 25.507,
   "text": "Instead,",
   "dur": 0.72,
   "voiced": 17,
   "sim": 0.442,
   "f0": 121.388,
   "st": 0.199,
   "range_st": 11.759,
   "asr": 1.0,
   "attempts": 1,
   "level": 0
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "s": 25.881,
   "e": 33.355,
   "text": "they engineered structural adaptability directly within the rigid mathematical geometry of dense tensor matrices.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 7.474,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "s": 34.69,
   "e": 37.723,
   "text": "They achieved this through two revolutionary innovations.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.032,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "s": 38.938,
   "e": 41.814,
   "text": "First, through fine-grained Mixture of Experts.",
   "dur": 2.876,
   "voiced": 130,
   "sim": 0.705,
   "f0": 116.539,
   "st": -0.507,
   "range_st": 12.581,
   "asr": 0.714,
   "attempts": 5,
   "level": 2,
   "weak": true
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "s": 43.064,
   "e": 48.172,
   "text": "DeepSeek-V3 deploys two hundred and fifty-six routed experts in each layer.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.108,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "s": 48.491,
   "e": 52.599,
   "text": "For any given token, a routing gate dynamically activates only eight of them,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.108,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "s": 52.84,
   "e": 55.907,
   "text": "alongside one shared expert that every token uses.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.067,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "s": 57.173,
   "e": 61.253,
   "text": "This achieves extreme conditional specialization and sparse execution,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "s": 61.625,
   "e": 68.025,
   "text": "while keeping every expert a dense, hardware-friendly matrix, connected through collective all-to-all communication primitives.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.4,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "s": 69.001,
   "e": 72.716,
   "text": "Second, through Multi-head Latent Attention, or MLA.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.715,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "s": 73.031,
   "e": 77.711,
   "text": "Instead of incurring massive memory bottlenecks with raw key-value caches,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "s": 77.986,
   "e": 84.66,
   "text": "MLA dynamically compresses keys and values into a compact low-dimensional latent vector,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.674,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "s": 84.909,
   "e": 88.091,
   "text": "decompressing them on the fly during attention computation.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.182,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "s": 89.157,
   "e": 91.957,
   "text": "Notice how this resolves the paradox:",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "s": 92.064,
   "e": 98.308,
   "text": "frontier AI labs proved that modularity and dynamic routing do not come from abolishing the tensor monolith.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.244,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "s": 99.374,
   "e": 105.607,
   "text": "They come from designing structured, hardware-aligned routing mechanisms on top of dense matrix multiplication.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.233,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "s": 105.827,
   "e": 109.073,
   "text": "You gain the efficiency of conditional specialization",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.245,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "s": 109.306,
   "e": 113.49,
   "text": "without paying the catastrophic cache penalty of irregular graph rewiring.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.184,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "s": 114.545,
   "e": 118.98,
   "text": "By combining fine-grained mixture of experts with multi-head latent attention,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 4.435,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "s": 119.145,
   "e": 125.585,
   "text": "DeepSeek-V3 activates only thirty-seven billion of its six hundred and seventy-one billion parameters per token,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 6.44,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "s": 125.781,
   "e": 128.614,
   "text": "and its report describes a remarkably stable training run.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.833,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "s": 128.834,
   "e": 132.288,
   "text": "Rather than letting the graph self-organize at random,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 3.454,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "s": 132.689,
   "e": 137.706,
   "text": "the architecture uses learned soft routing over statically defined expert banks.",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 5.017,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "s": 138.497,
   "e": 141.354,
   "text": "Modularity is alive and thriving at the frontier,",
   "sim": 0.0,
   "dur": 2.856,
   "asr": 0.0,
   "trusted": true,
   "attempts": 0,
   "reused": true
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "s": 141.876,
   "e": 145.236,
   "text": "not as an unruly biological graph,",
   "dur": 3.36,
   "voiced": 232,
